OL,5,G1400 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FJessica comes to the aid of a
OL,7,     Fpromising young reporter when he
OL,8,     Fis suspected of murdering a rival
OL,9,     Fmagazine's unscrupulous publisher.
OL,10,G1500 Murder She Wrote
OL,11,     FA virtual reality game is based on
OL,12,     Fa book Jessica wrote on murder.
OL,13,     FShe is fascinated by the game,
OL,14,     Funtil she believes she finds a
OL,15,     Freal murder in play.
OL,16,G1600 Murder She Wrote
OL,17,     FA racehorse trainer is killed
OL,18,     Fwhile on his way to expose racing
OL,19,     Ffraud, though there is also
OL,20,     Fconcern over whether or not his
OL,21,     Fdaughter had permission to ride.
