OL,5,G1700 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FJessica goes to Ireland to visit a
OL,7,     Frecently widowed friend whose
OL,8,     Fhusband's death, according to
OL,9,     Fgossip, was hardly an accident.
OL,10,G1800 Murder She Wrote
OL,11,     FWhen a crooked cop is murdered,
OL,12,     Fthere are three suspects - his
OL,13,     Fdaughter's jilted lover, an
OL,14,     Fillegal casino owner and an
OL,15,     Faccountant.
OL,16,G1900 Abandoned Engineering
OL,17,     FA ruined compound on the edge of a
OL,18,     Fpeninsula in Colombia which was
OL,19,     Fhome to a famous outlaw, and alien
OL,20,     Flooking structures, isolated and
OL,21,     Fmarooned in an empty English
OL,22,     Fmarshland.
